      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds good. can you write out the actual content for the banking lesson? like, instead of just saying \"redlining happened,\" can you write it in a way that explains why these things are still the primary reason for the wealth gap today? i want it to feel pretty definitive so the kids get the gravity of the situation.",
